  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Evaluation of Danida support to Gender Equality in Danish Development  Cooperation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ELK is commissioning an evaluation to evaluate the Danish support for improving Gender Equality, Girls&#x2019; and Women&#x2019;s Rights in Danish Development Cooperation (2014-2021) to learn from implementation of previous programs and projects in terms of addressing gender issues with a view to strengthening Denmark integration of gender equality, girls&#x2019; and women&#x2019;s rights in Danish Development Cooperation.</narrative>
  </description>
